@page "/product"
@layout MarketingLayout

<div class="mkt-product">

    <!-- HEADER -->
    <section class="mkt-page-header">
        <div class="mkt-page-header__inner">
            <div class="mkt-section-label">One system, four applications</div>
            <h1>Everything runs on the same intelligence.</h1>
            <p>Radar Intelligence, Learn, Career and Insights all draw from one engine — so the report you read this morning can become a learning pathway this afternoon, and evidence in your portfolio by next week.</p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- PRODUCT 1: INTELLIGENCE -->
    <section class="mkt-product-section mkt-product-section--alt">
        <div class="mkt-product-section__inner">
            <div class="mkt-product-section__text">
                <div class="mkt-product-icon mkt-product-icon--teal">
                    <div style="width:18px;height:18px;border-radius:50%;border:2px solid #008c93;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;"><div style="width:5.5px;height:5.5px;border-radius:50%;background:#008c93;"></div></div>
                </div>
                <div class="mkt-product-section__label">RADAR INTELLIGENCE</div>
                <h2>Understand the world in five minutes.</h2>
                <p>Radar continuously monitors trusted sources — government, research, industry, global institutions — and turns every document into a briefing: what happened, why it matters, who's affected, and what to do next. No two people see the same feed.</p>
                <ul class="mkt-checklist">
                    <li><span class="mkt-checklist__arrow">→</span>One-minute overview and five-minute summary for every source</li>
                    <li><span class="mkt-checklist__arrow">→</span>Personalised by role, region and interests</li>
                    <li><span class="mkt-checklist__arrow">→</span>Everything linked into your growing knowledge graph</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
            <div class="mkt-product-section__visual">
                <div class="mkt-product-mockup mkt-product-mockup--intelligence"></div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- PRODUCT 2: LEARN -->
    <section class="mkt-product-section">
        <div class="mkt-product-section__inner mkt-product-section__inner--reverse">
            <div class="mkt-product-section__visual">
                <div class="mkt-product-mockup mkt-product-mockup--learn"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="mkt-product-section__text">
                <div class="mkt-product-icon mkt-product-icon--amber">
                    <div style="display:flex;align-items:flex-end;gap:2.5px;height:18px;">
                        <div style="width:4.5px;height:8px;border-radius:1px;background:#b7791a;"></div>
                        <div style="width:4.5px;height:13px;border-radius:1px;background:#b7791a;"></div>
                        <div style="width:4.5px;height:18px;border-radius:1px;background:#b7791a;"></div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="mkt-product-section__label">RADAR LEARN</div>
                <h2>Master a valuable skill, step by step.</h2>
                <p>No more guessing what to learn next. Radar builds a complete pathway toward a real goal — resources, projects, and assessments, all connected — and always knows what you've mastered and what's left.</p>
                <ul class="mkt-checklist">
                    <li><span class="mkt-checklist__arrow">→</span>Skill maps that show exactly where you stand</li>
                    <li><span class="mkt-checklist__arrow">→</span>Practical projects, not just lessons</li>
                    <li><span class="mkt-checklist__arrow">→</span>Every project feeds your Career portfolio</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- PRODUCT 3: CAREER -->
    <section class="mkt-product-section mkt-product-section--alt">
        <div class="mkt-product-section__inner">
            <div class="mkt-product-section__text">
                <div class="mkt-product-icon mkt-product-icon--indigo">
                    <div style="position:relative;width:17px;height:18px;">
                        <div style="width:16px;height:16px;border-radius:50%;background:#5b6bd9;"></div>
                        <div style="position:absolute;top:12px;left:4.5px;width:0;height:0;border-left:3.5px solid transparent;border-right:3.5px solid transparent;border-top:5.5px solid #5b6bd9;"></div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="mkt-product-section__label">RADAR CAREER</div>
                <h2>Prove your capability — not just claim it.</h2>
                <p>A CV tells people what you say you've done. Radar builds a living Intelligence Portfolio from what you actually do — learning history, completed projects, assessments — and rolls it into your RCIS score.</p>
                <ul class="mkt-checklist">
                    <li><span class="mkt-checklist__arrow">→</span>Every lesson, article, paper and project you finish, tracked</li>
                    <li><span class="mkt-checklist__arrow">→</span>A portfolio that grows automatically, no manual updates</li>
                    <li><span class="mkt-checklist__arrow">→</span>Discoverable by employers searching for verified skills</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
            <div class="mkt-product-section__visual">
                <div class="mkt-product-mockup mkt-product-mockup--career">
                    <div class="mkt-career-score">
                        <div class="mkt-career-score__header">
                            <span>Roadmap progress</span>
                            <span class="mkt-career-score__pct">68%</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="mkt-career-score__row">
                            <div class="mkt-career-score__row-label"><span>Learning consistency</span><span>96</span></div>
                            <div class="mkt-career-score__bar"><div style="width:96%;"></div></div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="mkt-career-score__row">
                            <div class="mkt-career-score__row-label"><span>Knowledge depth</span><span>91</span></div>
                            <div class="mkt-career-score__bar"><div style="width:91%;"></div></div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="mkt-career-score__row">
                            <div class="mkt-career-score__row-label"><span>Projects</span><span>89</span></div>
                            <div class="mkt-career-score__bar"><div style="width:89%;"></div></div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="mkt-career-score__row">
                            <div class="mkt-career-score__row-label"><span>Leadership</span><span>82</span></div>
                            <div class="mkt-career-score__bar"><div style="width:82%;"></div></div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- PRODUCT 4: INSIGHTS -->
    <section class="mkt-product-section">
        <div class="mkt-product-section__inner mkt-product-section__inner--reverse">
            <div class="mkt-product-section__visual">
                <div class="mkt-product-mockup mkt-product-mockup--insights"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="mkt-product-section__text">
                <div class="mkt-product-icon mkt-product-icon--green">
                    <div style="position:relative;width:18px;height:18px;">
                        <div style="position:absolute;left:2px;bottom:3.5px;width:11px;height:2px;border-radius:1px;background:#1f9d63;transform-origin:0% 100%;transform:rotate(-35deg);"></div>
                        <div style="position:absolute;top:1px;right:1px;width:5px;height:5px;border-top:2px solid #1f9d63;border-right:2px solid #1f9d63;transform:rotate(45deg);"></div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="mkt-product-section__label">RADAR INSIGHTS</div>
                <h2>Decide with evidence, not assumptions.</h2>
                <p>Built for leaders. Instead of waiting for an annual report, see engagement, capability growth, and outcomes as they happen — with a dashboard tailored to the decision each role actually makes.</p>
                <ul class="mkt-checklist">
                    <li><span class="mkt-checklist__arrow">→</span>Role-specific dashboards — VC, CEO, HR Director, Minister</li>
                    <li><span class="mkt-checklist__arrow">→</span>Live, not quarterly</li>
                    <li><span class="mkt-checklist__arrow">→</span>See the detail in <a href="/institutions">institution dashboards →</a></li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- CTA -->
    <section class="mkt-cta-section">
        <div class="mkt-cta-card">
            <div class="mkt-cta-card__content">
                <h2>See all four products working together.</h2>
                <p>One engine. One account. Four ways to turn knowledge into outcomes.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="mkt-cta-card__actions">
                <a href="/" class="btn btn--dark btn--lg">Start free</a>
                <a href="/how-it-works" class="btn btn--outline-white btn--lg">See how it works</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

</div>
